                    autoscalePolicyServiceSupplier.get().setAutoscalePolicyOnServer(
                        modifyServerConfig.getMachineConfig().getAutoscalePolicy(), server
                    ).jobFuture()
                )
            );
        }

        return modifyServerFuture;
    }

